          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore te nkolong e uni naa iloing'ok tomon o obo, o lmeregeshi oare, o sitiman le kerra tomon o ong'uan lo lari obo lemeeta ntiot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "te nebo olasar le ntapa o lasarri ooki te lelo oing'ok, o loo lmeregeshi, o loo sitiman le kerra, te nkikenata te risioroto e nkitanapata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te nebo sii ositima obo le kine to lasar le ng'oki, epudare ilo asar opejori le anaake o lasar lenye le ntapa o lasar lenye ooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
