        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore te nkolong e imiet naa iloing'ok ooudo, o lmeregeshi oare, o sitiman le kerra tomon o ong'uan lo lari obo lemeeta entioto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.26"
