        {
          "text": "kake enchooi olasar opejori, ilo asar le nkima, esong'ouna narropil to Laitoriani; aapolos oloing'oni obo, o lmeregesh obo, o sitiman oopishana le kerra lo lari obo lemeeta entioto, ",
          "type": "text",
